  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78c7f49c0a169f8fbf8cf69f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”，\n这是由粉丝票选出谁有参赛资格的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d801a51b4efb04779f2597b62357e14cb016d2618204e48bb7794cfeb35c76a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f427ab816f609a2b9c85005c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩因为在经典赛表现活跃\n而从粉丝手上获得高票，\n名正言顺地获得了参赛权。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba9267dbf56b3658b591a93b4579529d02c74244ae2c25d13ea440d0aa51bac8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a973f0c818c3dde5ae838d48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "包含被称作“怪物”的小栗帽在内，\n其他古马级赛马娘也会参加这场盛大的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c128d3d40bca825836d0706408ca582881a54c09776fee228f9eb3275770f5b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14345a8330da2d93d8983a33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对这些实力深不可测的赛马娘，\n目白赖恩怀抱着畏惧前往参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bcd3b0bb1127a40e0695992900e3e7ae9c70d4487bd251cf6a0df33184393fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b12a668c46a6ecb8a7eb468",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eaef54ef4fcc7ecad6e69cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了她与目白麦昆首次在古马级的GⅠ赛事\n交锋的日子，也就是“天皇赏（春）”。\n这必然会是一场激战",
      "source_fingerprint": "27dd07a7e1a15e08af753fa9b9061a6e23464377158a0840cef1615447bde426",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf1b6426dae71457b77ec6f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆想赢得这场比赛，\n借此达成自己的夙愿。\n目白赖恩则是要透过阻挡她证明自己的价值。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f54fe5ada0f0c2c7fd2ddf34fe635c4cacda234b9736085f87c5819eaea2f8a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cf1974a30da09f47a19489d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这场双方互不退让的对决……现在正式开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ce434d15e47bcb927da28ffc97909a681e42c2001845e85520cefa1cc2c4609",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b6b9888d0ea6ad2af42ebad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向天皇赏（春）",
      "source_fingerprint": "787a30dcdda7188675e08b67055e274860a6c1346bc76e36d7243b3c8364986b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80bb8255599621c798b6d16d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”终于开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57e43334aaf4d527b2f9b1dc7add3ef53107224da9b076dbf688b501ccb49088",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3002496b9957284e400bce1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆看着自信满满的目白赖恩，\n察觉她已经克服内心的软弱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f28bc682115f054458cb0bef5d805bcf88ea4046dcf4aa6ee53a4fdbb366030f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a6e8480029b833a313afcb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩自豪地表示正因为过去缺乏自信，\n才会不断地锻炼直到自己满意为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb2382a2de50b58c12a4c2435b1edb77441514dbd6909afb0cddb76bcb67f73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddc437b29df50e03f59af9cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着她迈向赌上梦想的战场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0351c8599c4fb31a8ba0a1a349f872d038469a9d70be9ca5dc7249591b569b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74bbe7bab71adc0137a6ee8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向宝冢纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "4743315d92bef0a1d3815aad5f8b1374f193f12e0416639bccc69a7a0dc88f06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ea7048a02b34b3bcd45ff5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”当天。\n据说这是天赋过人的\n小栗帽的最后一场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8d9475c40b7c2af3569bacfa1b65e353e4a93ed05e3c95d5682d6e84bbd0456",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cdd0e5a06bd161c0b0c26c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩高声宣告，\n不会让小栗帽变成这场比赛的主角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "056ef11dc5bbf61f3aae5b9a0f348594e689f444eacb813471f9f761d0d300b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecf0c8154d2223b03a69427e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽、目白麦昆……",
      "source_fingerprint": "74763319c22cef25666842defb046fa19c4a3eef76e1a64e61a5babd16935af1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818e2ab453432b58066f35bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以及目白赖恩。\n三人各自怀抱着不同想法──\n“有马纪念”即将开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50b747e2e9dd89dcb0cbb375f59160d234f653a1188bafc4b312582745ac57bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:707729acce9e061083e59ff6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5f6de2ca48d47292dda4b47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩在“出道战”表现优异。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c090f37ab8b950b6fa86acd49b0d752177f3a5f9e50958020beb3f12f36d4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f9b9bae992c76b7b7eb169c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她开心地说\n这样就能向目白家的奶奶报告好消息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bda44c4ee8609b9d5af82edea90edade2577423f32b2e61341a85bf323934663",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f1df5e7f58aaf778a509f61",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且接下来……\n为了在经典路线打响名号，\n她决定下一个目标就是“新马级杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e68127de269aad51a5470d4ef6967215dc09c07a933119353ba89569194f1c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37d273d36ba894ea7b891fe5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・两人独自出航",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a8553e4ca5a672b698104ecb741b390ff84cbe340ba0af2f7750b698a5e6dde",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1be6c04616483697477fe339",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“新马级杯”全力奔跑的目白赖恩获得了\n站上憧憬舞台的机会后，大为欢喜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e9b0f060891057601c97658b6ef0a48ef7f525046324c4c1bb4aebeba41e2f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6f4c8af8bd90f195b5a678",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不久后，直播其他赛场状况的屏幕里\n传来了热烈的欢呼声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d34edaf9c4bef29d37b13ac972c1d99c45c742655f153f744a26393ead8d2e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df3d729e2e38f1e79218e42e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那些欢呼声全是为了一路遥遥领先，\n获得压倒性胜利的艾尼斯风神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0cfdc1b7b2b3a122e278a3655fc84b66d172beddc672141b5d4b33230e25eed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cded009c82ea14b51dadc12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "获胜的艾尼斯风神在接受访谈时，\n对目白赖恩高声宣告，\n要在“皋月赏”与她对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fbf33ad4d0640792967d1563cc49d561b10e987b6c62d26cd7a74a785f054e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04858743e7c2d1b8b8e50bf9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新马级杯结束后・竞争对手出现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7156ed452a751d738354f6124768fb8242d74614c007f2024b0bd3cb2ad48a33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a4b02f055811fb13774aa50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩竭尽全力奔跑，\n甚至在比赛结束后一点力气都使不出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "549d9aa1c6bbb6c2aaa11a6686cacc8ce14f708d302009df8027c07abf3ff953",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f96e4608724671cf709eb9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她证明了自己过去累积的努力没有白费后，\n轻轻地松了口气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d99b7461896c7cd9a9c053bdfd5ccde7cb27abe2536b51c962b04f24d3a8549a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc08992d5af5b85a1e84bede",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神赞赏她的表现，\n并且提议在接下来举办的\n“日本德比”再次对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ddc2899a05623f3132bf1a17a6312b8fd701788916f6e0e4b9f7fae8045984a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28b3535421cbd87bba93a099",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "纵使目白赖恩认为必须绷紧神经\n面对接下来的比赛……不过她还是选择\n当下沉浸在赢得“皋月赏”的余韵当中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df3c3279a2641e4f300a6befc3c8e368ffde68dfd11715637b5002ca11436625",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccfee451f7fdbe0d56a0b478",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・燃烧殆尽……",
      "source_fingerprint": "500c0cc595bae84433102f97710d4cef4240e0fa5a1e8913241bda80a44330b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
