    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56bca4b16cdcac233f635a40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "认真的对决结束后，\n观众对带来这场火热比赛的目白赖恩与\n艾尼斯风神投以热烈的掌声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dce5dcfe6b6302817e94eebd5f99996c59cae752ca713a9894a49e901345110",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
