    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e70e8bb951a7e3faf60f3da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩透过这场激烈的比赛重新燃起气势，\n对接下来的“菊花赏”变得更加积极。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84bd99fbe43ce3d22d622891ab1108e0b909fd97cacbc499d68578c37ad19e39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
