    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e92ade52d92597f34fda9be2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，\n来看目白赖恩比赛的目白麦昆也开始想像\n自己与实力变强的她对决的景象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c66363e1a517349ef9c03b238880ee414a7fc85adf3402539e5f2aa9e1b2f82d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
