    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b401739f192ef1c679b3ec36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・525米的青春",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0b77d0d8adc0059703a15f8f540aafe0b7d25fe04963d4a0d93a1f38c92939b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:accf6c9dae91ac76ebe1fa02",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛结束了……\n目白赖恩感慨万千的呐喊响彻了会场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74c21c9875ce77794dcb3f98358ac216fb2d6032867fabf03dd0485f35fe830d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:298cfd8bb71a6e073c1cb86b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中落败的目白麦昆赞扬获得胜利的她，\n宣告这场胜负将是目白家黄金时代的开端。",
      "source_fingerprint": "993df98473d1cb0d0d51ef6f41fdc0d8922f375442a84fb31a9943b0d4534c18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25a956ee3bbdf444c586ba10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "让目白赖恩获得了丰硕成果的“菊花赏”，\n就这样落幕了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a76725ac8980b1583ed15838f4a8f3a04faac03a60f4662d7f2bebd195b4f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f646a0604582ff455edb895",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一场战斗是“有马纪念”。\n面对有着未知强敌的比赛，\n目白赖恩展开了行动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9c7d0c2bb3313d7b2e1dc691c569eef4f98292716be52dd97ac9f8592b16c2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9591dbf65510425142baa69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・新时代的预感",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc9c5e19238c2c7169f1cfbd6d5f10cef0c3166449a49a622e12b408f005d5a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1760eb2c5d18055fb2a10f49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“菊花赏”的舞台拿下胜利的是\n展现了自己引以为傲的长距离实力的\n目白麦昆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28f96a62d30bbdb1060297a1b182b0bc633a09583ecbf1e114b308d3d3eb10cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31bbe51fd8822cdf4b4b1eab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩对两人之间的实力差距感到悔恨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc4193f50dc4db3009446d08b784879eab248b1d6c97a93da73711281f0a1911",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bcd9bb8c7dc347a85c9d7e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于不甘心的目白赖恩，\n目白麦昆表示期待她在下一场比赛的\n最后一浪能有优异的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c23bb2ffae2eab8764f036b37bb8f798c4425779c7288bbfe04022095f35d9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b0bd234e0c478d0aa46362",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“菊花赏”落幕，下场赛事是“有马纪念”。\n面对有着未知强敌的比赛，\n目白赖恩展开了行动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1f9a1c6b2675a7558db9789cf142621d4166338e2f513a4055de97caba9239c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:558bf590dc5a07920f5545ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・人生的长途跑者",
      "source_fingerprint": "127e7d7b16231f4f322ee825f951e403155613f6321a22c2a178554c03297b84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bfbc1254cb53c4f81eb91c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩在名为“有马纪念”的大舞台\n全力奔跑，留下了不错的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "345d3a72a1373268c7fa2cd6b10513c133ff823c523fa1f1c2e17780547a630d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d63603866578d03e5d7057f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽认可目白赖恩的实力，\n与她约定明年也要在这个舞台再次对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1de59794ac8341ff34b2a5c5338ad93185530fee849b3d9288ee6ef906ac5582",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6190d529ae9028c635a7f5a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩将这场比赛的经验铭记于心，\n为了再次与目白麦昆对决，\n把“天皇赏（春）”设定为下一个目标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3daa3279f36a62c78d0a5038abb0a483b30afdb7d4f1e31263df03e5b81faf80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62db25b2f7febd8f8ab76245",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・肌肉的奇迹",
      "source_fingerprint": "af56cf70067c52e909e4f533786a72bcba0afd1d40a4315eefa3cd7a4dfa79d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d30d5fd68544737d6f56adfd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩在“有马纪念”努力奋战，\n但依然不敌小栗帽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80fbab306add3d9c8b3f76ec1a1b640415c5295741acac845338a7e4b8eda5ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
