    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdadef59bd45e9c1da1d1b9e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过小栗帽认可目白赖恩的实力，\n与她约定明年也要在这个舞台再次对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9d0cd1d3c5099248ffeabcf3e68d677417362e57cb33b4f88295fc7d71849d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
