    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5cbdbc6752277a812ecef44",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（春）”──\n使出全力的目白赖恩最终获得胜利，\n阻止目白麦昆达成夙愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85617bc694c7fc45e115af7d40c450934c8bc0dfef58b3aca78045ee983229ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
