      "uid": "zhcn:e0b573af8677f66cc65f2c47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "使出全力的目白赖恩……\n输给了赌上一生挑战“天皇赏（春）”的\n目白麦昆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cfb4062c8da703a3d30562be5b5e083710f90e8a89e1efbf2652fc837cc51ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
