      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆对奋力战斗的目白赖恩表示敬意，\n并与她约定下次要在她擅长的距离一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85a03205327cadb64f9b198ae6367f90e5106a419e6d77774eb94d465b453275",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
